Package: rENM.data
Type: Package
Title: Data assembly tools for the rENM framework
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "John L.", family = "Schnase",
    email = "rENM.Framework@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7473-3977"))
Description: Provides data acquisition and preparation tools for the
    rENM framework, including extraction of eBird occurrence records and
    MERRA-2 environmental variables, spatial thinning, record limiting,
    extent determination, and temporal binning into five-year intervals.
